OL,3,APM plans debt re-set for Commonwealth
OL,4,Anations as slavery apology talks begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe issue of reparations, compensation
OL,7,Fto those who were the victims of
OL,8,Fslavery, has dominated debate in the
OL,9,Fbuild up to this summit, in which
OL,10,Frepresentatives from 56 Commonwealth
OL,11,Fcountries are meeting.
OL,13,F"Britain is bringing a new approach to
OL,14,Fthis meeting," the prime minister said,
OL,15,Fin a tacit acknowledgement that the
OL,16,Flast Commonwealth gathering, on the
OL,17,FPacific island of Samoa two years ago,
OL,18,Fdid not go well from a UK perspective.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
