OL,3,AThousands of European troops to
OL,4,Arehearse Ukraine deployment in event of
OL,5,Apeace
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritain and France are to lead a
OL,8,Fmilitary exercise to test a
OL,9,Fmultinational force's ability to deploy
OL,10,Fto Ukraine, if there is a peace deal.
OL,12,FNearly 3,000 military personnel from 12
OL,13,FEuropean nations will take part in the
OL,14,Frehearsal in neighbouring Poland this
OL,15,Fmonth.
OL,17,FPlans for a reassurance force for
OL,18,FUkraine were set out last year as one
OL,19,Fof the long-term security guarantees
OL,20,Fbeing proposed by European nations.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
