OL,3,AShop freezers in seven European
OL,4,Acountries hit by cyber-attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of supermarkets across seven
OL,7,FEuropean countries have been hit by a
OL,8,Fcyber-attack affecting their
OL,9,Frefrigerators and freezers.
OL,11,FAround 40 Delhaize supermarkets in
OL,12,FBelgium and Luxembourg were affected,
OL,13,Fwhile a smaller number of shops were
OL,14,Fhit in Sweden, Ireland, the
OL,15,FNetherlands, Estonia and Finland.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
